=== cd ===
cd <path>
cd to <tp-alias>
=== cd to ===
cd to <tp-alias>
=== cd to some_tp ===
<cr> press enter to run it
=== cd src ===
<cr> press enter to run it
=== ignore ===
dir
ext
file
=== ignore dir ===
ignore dir <dir_name>
=== ignore dir foo ===
<cr> press enter to run it
=== care ext ===
care ext <ext>
=== tp ===
add
jump
to
info
list
ls
rm
rnm
rename
cls
help
=== tp jump ===
tp jump <tp-alias>
=== tp jump foo ===
<cr> press enter to run it
=== arc ===
create
extract
list
help
=== arc create ===
arc create <out.zip|tar.gz|tgz|tar> <files...>
  e.g. arc create backup.zip src Cargo.toml
